    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d617">

                <pb facs="0653" n="545" sameAs="frus:frus1927v02/pg545"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">839.00/3035: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Minister in the Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Young</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-03-03T11:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 3,
                                1927—11 a.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>10. Your No. 20, February 28, 5 p.m. Department agrees with you that for the
                    present you should continue your informal representations based on the
                    stipulations and spirit of Plan of Evacuation of 1922,<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d617-f1"/> Keep Department informed by telegraph of future
                    developments.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
